                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">February</hi> 2, 1894.—Referred
                    to the Committee on Foreign Affairs and ordered to be printed.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Congress</hi>:</p>
                <p>I hereby transmit a communication from the Secretary of State, accompanying a
                    dispatch received a few days ago from our minister at Hawaii.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grover Cleveland.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Executive
                            Mansion</hi>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-02-02"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 2, 1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>




